> burst=1  tx:4.9 Mpps
> burst=2  tx:6.6 Mpps
> burst=3  tx:7.9 Mpps
> burst=4  tx:8.7 Mpps
> burst=8  tx:10.3 Mpps
> burst=128  tx:12.4 Mpps
